# VantageOS Custom Layer

This layer contains VantageOS-specific customizations for OpenEmbedded/Yocto builds.

## Contents

- `conf/layer.conf` - Layer configuration
- `recipes-core/images/` - Custom image recipes
- `recipes-example/` - Example recipe structure

## Adding this layer

Add the layer to your `bblayers.conf`:

```bash
bitbake-layers add-layer /path/to/layers/meta-vantageos
```

## Compatibility

Tested with Yocto/OpenEmbedded releases:
- Kirkstone (4.0)
- Langdale (4.1)
- Mickledore (4.2)
- Nanbield (4.3)
- Scarthgap (5.0)
